normalized.text:
{
  "summary": "This first experiment established a minimal baseline using RNA-only modality, a single profile, and a PCA(2000) encoder with no image input, aggregation, or fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.485 (F1: 0.464) provides an initial reference point for the raw RNA signal under this deterministic, untrained encoder setup, but with no prior experiments for comparison, the result cannot be attributed to any specific design choice. It serves as a performance floor from which the incremental contribution of multiprofile aggregation, alternative encoders, image modality, and fusion strategies can be assessed in subsequent experiments."
}

